        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "16-3 All monitoring or observation of the work performed by a teacher will be conducted openly and with full knowledge of that teacher. The use of eavesdropping, public address systems and similar devices will be strictly prohibited, except as spelled out in Section 16-3-1.",
