        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "16–6 Probationary teachers with less than five (5) years total experience will be evaluated once each semester for three (3) years. Probationary teachers with more than five (5) years successful experience will be evaluated once each semester for the first year in Jefferson County and one (1) evaluation for years two (2) and three (3) satisfactory performance is demonstrated during the first year. Non-probationary teachers who are demonstrating satisfactory performance will receive at least one (1) evaluation in years five (5) and seven (7) in Jefferson County. Non-probationary teachers who are demonstrating satisfactory performance and have over seven (7) years in Jefferson County will receive one (1) evaluation every three (3) years. More frequent evaluation cycles may be determined by the building principal.",
